" We need competition so that the unions have an incentive to focus on academics as opposed to activism."

The National Education Association has become a political entity instead of a traditional teachers' union. As their value for education wanes, so should their special tax benefits and Congressional backing.

@DeAngelisCorey is a Research Fellow for the Center for Education Policy at the Heritage Foundation.

